{"id":"f6ad1f8f52dadb89","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-so-satisfiable.md","title":"Second-Order Satisfiable","display":"df-so-satisfiable — Second-Order Satisfiable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-so-satisfiable","aliases":["57-df-so-satisfiable"],"display":"df-so-satisfiable — Second-Order Satisfiable","depends_on":["[[57-df-so-formula]]","[[57-df-so-sentence]]","[[57-df-so-semantics]]","[[57-df-so-assignment]]","[[57-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-so-satisfiable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-so-satisfiable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-so-satisfiable — Second-Order Satisfiable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"433037f9b53db530\" href=\"?note=433037f9b53db530\" title=\"57-df-so-formula\">57-df-so-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fcf8e66483555f57\" href=\"?note=fcf8e66483555f57\" title=\"57-df-so-sentence\">57-df-so-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"521852a49020f617\" href=\"?note=521852a49020f617\" title=\"57-df-so-semantics\">57-df-so-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9fd59242fb4200e\" href=\"?note=b9fd59242fb4200e\" title=\"57-df-so-assignment\">57-df-so-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (签名, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> (S-结构, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A = |\\mathfrak{A}|\">\\(A = |\\mathfrak{A}|\\)</span> (论域, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}^2_S\">\\(\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}^2_S\\)</span> (公式集)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\)</span>；本文件二参数接口保留原来的占位首参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>，其值不影响单公式可满足性。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SO}\">\\(\\mathrm{SO}\\)</span> 是完全二阶语义的下标标记；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}(\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}(\\Phi)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}(\\Phi,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}(\\Phi,\\varphi)\\)</span> 分别是下式定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_S^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_S^2\\)</span> 一元、二元接口别名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}so\\text{-}satisfiable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Sat}^2_S(\\Phi) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\exists \\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Struct}_S \\;\\exists \\beta \\in \\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak{A}) \\;\\exists \\gamma \\in \\mathrm{Assgn}^2_S(\\mathfrak{A}) : \\forall \\psi \\in \\Phi : \\mathfrak{A}, \\beta, \\gamma \\models \\psi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}so\\text{-}satisfiable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Sat}^2_S(\\Phi) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\exists \\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Struct}_S \\;\\exists \\beta \\in \\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak{A}) \\;\\exists \\gamma \\in \\mathrm{Assgn}^2_S(\\mathfrak{A}) : \\forall \\psi \\in \\Phi : \\mathfrak{A}, \\beta, \\gamma \\models \\psi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}so\\text{-}satisfiable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Sat}^2_S(\\Phi, \\varphi) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\exists \\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Struct}_S \\;\\exists \\beta \\in \\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak{A}) \\;\\exists \\gamma \\in \\mathrm{Assgn}^2_S(\\mathfrak{A}) : \\mathfrak{A}, \\beta, \\gamma \\models \\varphi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}so\\text{-}satisfiable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Sat}^2_S(\\Phi, \\varphi) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\exists \\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Struct}_S \\;\\exists \\beta \\in \\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak{A}) \\;\\exists \\gamma \\in \\mathrm{Assgn}^2_S(\\mathfrak{A}) : \\mathfrak{A}, \\beta, \\gamma \\models \\varphi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}(\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sat}_S^2(\\Phi),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}(\\Phi,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sat}_S^2(\\Phi,\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}(\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sat}_S^2(\\Phi),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}(\\Phi,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sat}_S^2(\\Phi,\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}^2_S(\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}^2_S(\\Phi)\\)</span> : 公式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 在签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 上是<strong>二阶可满足的</strong></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}^2_S(\\Phi, \\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}^2_S(\\Phi, \\varphi)\\)</span> : 单个公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的可满足性（等同于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}^2_S(\\{\\varphi\\})\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}^2_S(\\{\\varphi\\})\\)</span>）</li>\n<li>定义解读：存在结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span>、一阶赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span>、二阶赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>，使得所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi \\in \\Phi\">\\(\\psi \\in \\Phi\\)</span> 同时为真</li>\n<li>二阶语义特点：\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists X^n\\,\\theta(X^n)\">\\(\\exists X^n\\,\\theta(X^n)\\)</span> 解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R \\subseteq A^n : \\mathfrak{A}, \\beta, \\gamma[X^n/R] \\models \\theta\">\\(\\exists R \\subseteq A^n : \\mathfrak{A}, \\beta, \\gamma[X^n/R] \\models \\theta\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall X^n\\,\\theta(X^n)\">\\(\\forall X^n\\,\\theta(X^n)\\)</span> 解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R \\subseteq A^n : \\mathfrak{A}, \\beta, \\gamma[X^n/R] \\models \\theta\">\\(\\forall R \\subseteq A^n : \\mathfrak{A}, \\beta, \\gamma[X^n/R] \\models \\theta\\)</span></li>\n<li>二阶变量的取值范围是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{P}(A^n)\">\\(\\mathcal{P}(A^n)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>句子情形：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}^2_S\">\\(\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}^2_S\\)</span>，则一阶赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 不影响可满足性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-so-formula","status":"resolved","id":"433037f9b53db530","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"fcf8e66483555f57","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"521852a49020f617","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"b9fd59242fb4200e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ (签名, see [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}$ (S-结构, see [[57-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A = |\\mathfrak{A}|$ (论域, see [[57-df-structure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A}","display":false},{"tex":"A = |\\mathfrak{A}|","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}^2_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2","display":